# School prices dataset

- Source of truth: `data/school-prices/school-prices.json` (`meta` + `schools[]`). The schema and provenance are in `data/school-prices/README.md`; read it first.
- Join to DriveLinkUp listings through `schools[].listingIds` (ids from `docs/cutover-school-roster.json`). Do not join on name; names are ambiguous. Unlinked listings are in `unmatched-listings.json`.
- Compare lesson prices with `lesson.pricePerMinuteSek`, because lesson lengths range from 30 to 80 min.
- Label prices as "published on the school's website" with `meta.collectedAt` and link `sourceUrl`. Never label them verified or confirmed, and never use them as booking or checkout amounts.
- `null` means "not published", not "free". Respect `status` when explaining missing prices.
- Importing into the DB needs a Discovery-owned migration plus a script under `scripts/` (see `database.mdc`). Do not edit the JSON by hand; regenerate it and update `meta`.
